# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the tests of PBeFS.
#
# The single-producer single-consumer queues of FastFlow are lock-free by
# design: they read and write the slots and the indices without atomic
# operations, ordering them with explicit memory barriers, which
# ThreadSanitizer does not understand. Only the internals of FastFlow are
# suppressed, so that the code of the library that uses them is checked.
race:ff::SWSR_Ptr_Buffer
race:ff::uSWSR_Ptr_Buffer
race:ff::Buffer_
race:ff::ff_node
race:ff::ff_thread
race:ff::ff_loadbalancer
race:ff::ff_gatherer
